---
import ServicesHeroLayout from "../../layout/ServicesHeroLayout.astro";
import ServicesLayout from "../../layout/ServicesLayout.astro";
import ServicesMainLayout from "../../layout/ServicesMainLayout.astro";
---

<ServicesLayout
  title="Faith & Recovery Podcast Guest | Angie Pichardo"
  description="Christian podcast guest Angie Pichardo — faith, recovery, and purpose. Available remotely or in-studio on shows about resilience and the A.L.I.G.N. framework."
  canonicalPath="/services/podcast-guest/"
  keywords={[
    "Christian podcast guest",
    "faith podcast guest speaker",
    "women's podcast guest",
    "Angie Pichardo podcast",
    "suicide survivor speaker podcast",
    "recovery podcast guest",
    "bilingual podcast guest",
    "A.L.I.G.N. framework podcast",
  ]}
>
  <ServicesHeroLayout>
    <h1 class="relative bottom-10 animate-slide-in-bottom animate-delay-100">
      Podcast Guest &amp; Media <br />
      Appearances
    </h1>
  </ServicesHeroLayout>

  <ServicesMainLayout>
    <!-- ── mission-intro ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <Fragment slot="mission-intro">
      Authentic, faith-rooted conversations on resilience, recovery, purpose,
      and what it really means to rebuild your life.
    </Fragment>

    <!-- ── mission-image ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <img
      slot="mission-image"
      src="/images/services/podcast.webp"
      alt="Angie Pichardo recording a podcast interview on faith and recovery"
      width="800"
      height="600"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top md:object-center"
    />

    <!-- ── mission-text ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <Fragment slot="mission-text">
      <p>
        <strong>Audiences remember the conversation that made them feel less alone.</strong>
        Angie brings her own story of grief, suicide loss, recovery, and
        rebuilt purpose to every interview — paired with scripture, practical
        wisdom, and the kind of honesty that builds trust quickly.
      </p>
      <p>
        Available for podcast guest spots, panel discussions, church events,
        recovery communities, leadership conversations, television, radio, and
        other media appearances. Trained through the Les Brown "Speaking for a
        Living" program.
      </p>
      <p>
        Remote interviews from a professional home studio, or in-studio when
        geography allows. English and Spanish.
      </p>
    </Fragment>

    <!-- ── best-for (4 cards) ─────────────────────────────────── -->
    <Fragment slot="best-for">
      <div
        class="group bg-angie-cream p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-angie-rose/20 hover:border-angie-rose/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/20 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-slide-in-bottom"
      >
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-angie-rose/20 group-hover:bg-angie-rose/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-angie-burgundy group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path>
            <path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path>
            <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="22"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-Frauce text-xl text-angie-noir">Faith &amp; Christian Podcasts</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-angie-noir/75 font-Grotesk text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Women's ministry, Bible study, devotional, and Christian living shows
          that want a guest with real-world grit, not just theory.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group bg-angie-cream p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-angie-rose/20 hover:border-angie-rose/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/20 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-slide-in-bottom"
      >
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-angie-rose/20 group-hover:bg-angie-rose/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-angie-burgundy group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-Frauce text-xl text-angie-noir">Recovery &amp; Mental Health</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-angie-noir/75 font-Grotesk text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Sobriety, suicide loss, grief, and mental health awareness shows
          that handle these topics with care and depth.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group bg-angie-cream p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-angie-rose/20 hover:border-angie-rose/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/20 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-slide-in-bottom"
      >
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-angie-rose/20 group-hover:bg-angie-rose/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-angie-burgundy group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-Frauce text-xl text-angie-noir">Leadership &amp; Entrepreneurship</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-angie-noir/75 font-Grotesk text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Women's leadership, founder stories, and purpose-driven business
          shows. Real talk about building a life and a business after loss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group bg-angie-cream p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-angie-rose/20 hover:border-angie-rose/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/20 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-slide-in-bottom"
      >
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-angie-rose/20 group-hover:bg-angie-rose/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-angie-burgundy group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-Frauce text-xl text-angie-noir">TV &amp; Radio Interviews</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-angie-noir/75 font-Grotesk text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Local and regional media appearances, including morning shows,
          news segments, and faith-based radio.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Fragment>

    <!-- ── investment (3 cards pricing) ──────────────────────── -->
    <Fragment slot="investment">
      <!-- Card FEATURED — Most Common (complimentary) -->
      <div
        class="w-full md:flex-1 md:max-w-md group relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-angie-wine via-angie-burgundy to-angie-noir p-7 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-angie-rose/70 ring-2 ring-angie-rose/20 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/50 hover:scale-[1.02] timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-zoom-in"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-2 bg-linear-to-br from-angie-rose/40 via-angie-burgundy/30 to-angie-rose/40 rounded-3xl blur-2xl opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 -z-10"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-full transition-transform duration-1000 ease-in-out bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/15 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>

        <span
          class="absolute top-4 right-4 z-20 bg-angie-rose text-angie-noir text-xs font-Grotesk-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-angie-rose/40"
        >
          Most Common
        </span>

        <div class="relative">
          <p class="text-angie-rose uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-xs font-Grotesk-bold">
            Podcast Guest
          </p>
          <p
            class="font-Frauce text-4xl md:text-4xl text-white mt-3 group-hover:text-angie-rose transition-colors duration-500"
          >
            Complimentary
          </p>
          <p class="text-white/85 font-Grotesk mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            For aligned missions and audience fit. 30–60 minute interviews via
            Zoom or in-studio. Includes pre-show call to align on tone and
            talking points.
          </p>
          <p class="text-white/60 font-Grotesk text-xs mt-4">
            Best for: aligned podcasts, mission-driven shows
          </p>
          <!-- CTAs: Book a Call (TidyCal) + Pay Now (Stripe) -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 mt-6">
            <a
              href="https://tidycal.com/angiepspeaks/30min-purpose-discoverycall"
              rel="noopener"
              class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-white/30 text-white font-Grotesk-bold text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:text-angie-noir hover:border-white transition-all duration-300"
            >
              Book a Call
            </a>
            <a
              href="#"
              data-stripe-link
              rel="noopener"
              class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 bg-angie-rose text-angie-noir font-Grotesk-bold text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-md"
            >
              Pay Now
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="w-full md:flex-1 md:max-w-md group relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-angie-wine to-angie-noir p-7 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-angie-burgundy/40 hover:border-angie-rose/70 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/30 timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-zoom-in"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-1 bg-linear-to-br from-angie-rose/30 to-angie-burgundy/30 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 -z-10"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-full transition-transform duration-1000 ease-in-out bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <p class="text-angie-rose uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-xs font-Grotesk-bold">
            Panel Discussions
          </p>
          <p
            class="font-Frauce text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white mt-3 group-hover:text-angie-rose transition-colors duration-500"
          >
            Contact
          </p>
          <p class="text-white/85 font-Grotesk mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Multi-speaker panels, summits, and live events. Virtual or
            in-person. Format, length, and fee scoped per engagement.
          </p>
          <p class="text-white/60 font-Grotesk text-xs mt-4">
            Best for: summits, virtual conferences, live events
          </p>
          <!-- CTAs: Book a Call (TidyCal) + Pay Now (Stripe) -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 mt-6">
            <a
              href="https://tidycal.com/angiepspeaks/30min-purpose-discoverycall"
              rel="noopener"
              class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-white/30 text-white font-Grotesk-bold text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:text-angie-noir hover:border-white transition-all duration-300"
            >
              Book a Call
            </a>
            <a
              href="#"
              data-stripe-link
              rel="noopener"
              class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 bg-angie-rose text-angie-noir font-Grotesk-bold text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-md"
            >
              Pay Now
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="w-full md:flex-1 md:max-w-md group relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-angie-wine to-angie-noir p-7 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-angie-burgundy/40 hover:border-angie-rose/70 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/30 timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-zoom-in"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-1 bg-linear-to-br from-angie-rose/30 to-angie-burgundy/30 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 -z-10"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-full transition-transform duration-1000 ease-in-out bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <p class="text-angie-rose uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-xs font-Grotesk-bold">
            Church &amp; Recovery Groups
          </p>
          <p
            class="font-Frauce text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white mt-3 group-hover:text-angie-rose transition-colors duration-500"
          >
            Contact
          </p>
          <p class="text-white/85 font-Grotesk mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            In-person or virtual talks for churches, recovery groups, and
            community organizations. Sliding scale available for smaller
            ministries.
          </p>
          <p class="text-white/60 font-Grotesk text-xs mt-4">
            Best for: ministries, recovery communities, support groups
          </p>
          <!-- CTAs: Book a Call (TidyCal) + Pay Now (Stripe) -->
          <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 mt-6">
            <a
              href="https://tidycal.com/angiepspeaks/30min-purpose-discoverycall"
              rel="noopener"
              class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-white/30 text-white font-Grotesk-bold text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:text-angie-noir hover:border-white transition-all duration-300"
            >
              Book a Call
            </a>
            <a
              href="#"
              data-stripe-link
              rel="noopener"
              class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 bg-angie-rose text-angie-noir font-Grotesk-bold text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-md"
            >
              Pay Now
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="investment-note">
      Podcast interviews for aligned shows are complimentary. All other
      appearances are scoped per engagement. Bilingual (English/Spanish)
      appearances available on request.
    </Fragment>

    <!-- ── how-to-book (3 pasos) ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <Fragment slot="how-to-book">
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/40 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 border border-angie-rose/20 hover:border-angie-rose/60 z-10 overflow-hidden timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-slide-in-bottom"
      >
        <!-- Watermark decorativo del numero -->
        <span
          class="absolute -right-4 -top-6 font-Frauce text-[8rem] md:text-[10rem] leading-none text-angie-rose/10 group-hover:text-angie-rose/20 transition-colors duration-500 select-none pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          01
        </span>

        <div
          class="relative w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-angie-rose/15 group-hover:bg-angie-rose/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <span class="font-Frauce text-2xl md:text-3xl text-angie-burgundy">01</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-Grotesk-bold text-angie-noir text-lg text-center">
          Reach Out
        </h3>
        <p class="text-angie-noir/75 font-Grotesk text-sm mt-2 text-center leading-relaxed">
          Send a message with your show name, audience size, and proposed
          topic. You will hear back within 48 hours.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center">
          <a
            href="https://tidycal.com/angiepspeaks/30min-purpose-discoverycall"
            rel="noopener"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 mt-4 text-angie-burgundy font-Grotesk-bold text-sm hover:text-angie-noir transition-colors duration-300"
          >
            Pitch the show
            <span class="inline-block transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group relative bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/40 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 border border-angie-rose/20 hover:border-angie-rose/60 z-10 overflow-hidden timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-slide-in-bottom"
      >
        <!-- Watermark decorativo del numero -->
        <span
          class="absolute -right-4 -top-6 font-Frauce text-[8rem] md:text-[10rem] leading-none text-angie-rose/10 group-hover:text-angie-rose/20 transition-colors duration-500 select-none pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          02
        </span>

        <div
          class="relative w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-angie-rose/15 group-hover:bg-angie-rose/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <span class="font-Frauce text-2xl md:text-3xl text-angie-burgundy">02</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-Grotesk-bold text-angie-noir text-lg text-center">
          Pre-Show Call
        </h3>
        <p class="text-angie-noir/75 font-Grotesk text-sm mt-2 text-center leading-relaxed">
          A short alignment call to confirm tone, talk tracks, and any
          sensitive topics to honor. Bring your hardest questions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group relative bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-angie-rose/40 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 border border-angie-rose/20 hover:border-angie-rose/60 z-10 overflow-hidden timeline-view animate-range-[5%_10%] animate-slide-in-bottom"
      >
        <!-- Watermark decorativo del numero -->
        <span
          class="absolute -right-4 -top-6 font-Frauce text-[8rem] md:text-[10rem] leading-none text-angie-rose/10 group-hover:text-angie-rose/20 transition-colors duration-500 select-none pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          03
        </span>

        <div
          class="relative w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-angie-rose/15 group-hover:bg-angie-rose/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <span class="font-Frauce text-2xl md:text-3xl text-angie-burgundy">03</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-Grotesk-bold text-angie-noir text-lg text-center">
          Record &amp; Share
        </h3>
        <p class="text-angie-noir/75 font-Grotesk text-sm mt-2 text-center leading-relaxed">
          We record, you edit, you publish. Angie will share the episode
          across her channels to help your show reach the people who need it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Fragment>

    <!-- ── faq (4 details) ───────────────────────────────────── -->
    <Fragment slot="faq">
      <details
        class="group/bg bg-angie-cream rounded-xl p-5 md:p-6 open:shadow-md transition"
      >
        <summary
          class="font-Grotesk-bold text-angie-noir cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span>What topics do you cover on podcasts?</span>
          <span
            class="text-angie-burgundy text-2xl leading-none transition group-open/bg:rotate-45"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p
          class="mt-4 text-angie-noir/80 font-Grotesk text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed"
        >
          Faith and recovery, suicide loss and grief, resilience, finding
          purpose after trauma, women's leadership, the A.L.I.G.N. framework,
          bilingual identity, and rebuilding your life when you thought it
          was over.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group/bg bg-angie-cream rounded-xl p-5 md:p-6 open:shadow-md transition"
      >
        <summary
          class="font-Grotesk-bold text-angie-noir cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span>Are you available for remote interviews?</span>
          <span
            class="text-angie-burgundy text-2xl leading-none transition group-open/bg:rotate-45"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p
          class="mt-4 text-angie-noir/80 font-Grotesk text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed"
        >
          Yes — most interviews are remote via Zoom, Riverside, SquadCast, or
          your platform of choice. Angie records from a quiet home setup with
          a professional microphone and stable internet. In-studio is
          available when geography allows.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group/bg bg-angie-cream rounded-xl p-5 md:p-6 open:shadow-md transition"
      >
        <summary
          class="font-Grotesk-bold text-angie-noir cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span>How long is a typical podcast interview?</span>
          <span
            class="text-angie-burgundy text-2xl leading-none transition group-open/bg:rotate-45"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p
          class="mt-4 text-angie-noir/80 font-Grotesk text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed"
        >
          Most interviews run 30 to 60 minutes. Angie is comfortable with
          longer conversational formats and quick 15-minute segments alike.
          Pre-show alignment keeps the recording tight.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group/bg bg-angie-cream rounded-xl p-5 md:p-6 open:shadow-md transition"
      >
        <summary
          class="font-Grotesk-bold text-angie-noir cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4"
        >
          <span>Is there an audience size requirement?</span>
          <span
            class="text-angie-burgundy text-2xl leading-none transition group-open/bg:rotate-45"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p
          class="mt-4 text-angie-noir/80 font-Grotesk text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed"
        >
          No hard minimum — mission alignment matters more than download
          numbers. Smaller, niche shows that serve the right audience are
          often the best fit. Send a pitch and let's talk.
        </p>
      </details>
    </Fragment>
  </ServicesMainLayout>
